  <Dialogues>k__BackingField:
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "Now we\u2019re talking, kid. Since you bought the
      Slow Time ability, there\u2019s a button in the bottom left corner of the screen."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b1cb82faed95ba4b87da762c903a1e8, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: When you click it, all of your ships will slow down
      on their orbits to give you more time to swap them around. You can also activate
      this ability by pressing Q.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe40fe75d7474bf45aba5790721e8c11, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "You\u2019ll see a bar that shows you how much time
      is left on the ability. After a cooldown, you\u2019ll be able to use it again."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1229d9a81f257254d9cb2e43ecd8b7b8, type: 3}
